SUMMARY:🌟 Membership Class at CSL Asheville 🌟
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🌟 Membership Class
  at CSL Asheville 🌟**\n\nAre you feeling called to deepen your connecti
 on with Center for Spiritual Living Asheville? Whether you are new to CSL 
 or returning to renew your commitment\, this Membership Class is a meaning
 ful opportunity to connect\, learn\, and belong.\n\n📅 Saturday 🕙 10:
 00 AM – 3:00 PM\n\n**✨ What to Expect**\n*🌀 10:00 AM – 12:00 PM*\
 n• Get to know one another\n• Explore the history and teachings of Sci
 ence of Mind\n• Learn about our global movement\, Centers for Spiritual 
 Living\n\n*🥗 12:00 PM – 1:00 PM*\n• Lunch and open conversation wit
 h members of our Board of Trustees\n\n*🌱 1:00 PM – 3:00 PM*\n• Disc
 over the history of Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n• Explore our
  shared vision for the future\n• Membership and Re-Membering ceremony pr
 eparation\n\n*💖 Already a Member Elsewhere or in the Past?*\nIf you hav
 e previously been a member at another Center for Spiritual Living—or hav
 e been a member here before—we warmly invite you to Re-Member.\n\n**🕊
  Attendance Notes**\n• You are welcome to join us for the entire day\n
 • To Re-Member or become a Member of CSL Asheville\, attendance is requi
 red only from 1:00 – 3:00 PM\n\n**🎉 Recognition & Celebration**\nNew 
 Members and those Re-Membering will be recognized and honored during our S
 unday Celebration the following day.\n\n**📝 Ready to Take the Next Step
 ?**\nTo express your interest in membership and this class\, please comple
 te the form below or contact our office:\n👉 https://cslasheville.breeze
 chms.com/form/22c853\n📞 828-253-2325 ext. 0\n\nWe look forward to welco
 ming you more fully into our spiritual community.\n\n***✨ You belong her
 e. ✨***\n\n#CommunityCommonsAsheville #CSLAsheville #MembershipClass #Sc
 ienceOfMind #SpiritualCommunity #ReMember #CentersForSpiritualLiving #NewM
 embers #SpiritualGrowth
