SUMMARY: 🌕✨Full Moon Flow\, Release\, & Renew Sound Bath 🌕✨
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**🌕✨ FLOW\, RELEAS
 E\, & RENEW ✨🌕**\n\nJoin me for a special Full Moon Sound Bath as we 
 continue our July journey with the soothing energy of water and the healin
 g vibrations of sound. Following The Cooling Current: A Water Element Soun
 d Bath\, this Full Moon gathering invites us to deepen into the flow of su
 mmer—releasing what no longer serves us and making space for clarity\, r
 enewal\, and inner peace. 🌊💙\n\nSummer invites us to slow down\, sof
 ten\, and reconnect with the natural rhythms of life. Under the energy of 
 the Full Moon\, we'll gather in sacred space to rest\, restore\, and allow
  the healing sounds of crystal singing bowls\, harp\, and chimes to carry 
 us into stillness and renewal.\n\n🌕 Wednesday\, July 29\, 2026\n🕕 6:
 00 PM\n💵 Sliding Scale: $10–$20\n\n**🧘‍♀️ Please bring:**\n
 ✨ Yoga mat\n✨ Blanket\n✨ Pillow\n✨ Any additional props that help 
 you feel comfortable\n\n🚪 Please arrive by 5:45 PM to claim your spot. 
 Doors close promptly at 6:00 PM. Seating is first come\, first served.\n\n
 Come rest beneath the energy of the Full Moon and allow sound\, water\, an
 d moonlight to guide you toward greater peace\, balance\, and renewal. 
 🌕🌊✨\n\n*💙 All are welcome. No experience necessary.*\n\n#Ashevi
 lleNC #SoundHealing #FullMoonSoundBath #AshevilleEvents #Meditation #Cryst
 alBowls #WaterElement #FullMoon #SummerWellness #SelfCare #SerenitySoundHe
 aling #MindBodySpirit #Relaxation
